sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as 🧑‍🏫 Admin / student
    participant CF as ⚡ CloudFront
    participant APP as 🖥️ App container
    participant IMDS as 🔐 EC2 metadata (role credentials)
    participant S3 as 🪣 S3 bucket
    participant DB as 🗄️ RDS MySQL

    A->>CF: POST /admin/api/courses/110/videos (multipart, up to 500 MB)
    CF->>APP: same request + X-Origin-Verify
    APP->>APP: check login, permission, file type (MP4/MOV/WebM signature)
    opt credentials missing or about to expire (every few hours)
        APP->>IMDS: IMDSv2 token → role credentials
        IMDS-->>APP: temporary key + session token
    end
    APP->>S3: PUT storage/uploads/courses/110/videos/<time>_clip.mp4 (SigV4 signed, streamed)
    S3-->>APP: 200 OK (encrypted at rest, versioned)
    APP-->>CF: {"url": "/storage/uploads/courses/110/videos/…"}
    CF-->>A: upload done
    A->>CF: Save lesson (the URL is stored with the lesson)
    CF->>APP: POST /admin/api/courses/110/lessons
    APP->>DB: UPDATE course_module_lessons SET video_url = '/storage/…'
    Note over A,DB: Students later play it from /storage/… → CloudFront → S3 (not through the server)
